James inquired about the necessity of reporting responses to the PRISMA 2020 Extended Checklist in the Supplementary Information (SI) section of his paper. I advised that including a completed PRISMA checklist is beneficial for demonstrating transparency and adherence to guidelines, particularly for systematic reviews or meta-analyses. This inclusion not only meets many journals' requirements but also enhances the credibility of the research. I suggested considering space constraints but emphasized the importance of clarity and comprehensiveness in the responses.
